CVE: CVE-2020-11022, CVE-2020-11023 (jQuery 3.4.1 inside minipaint)
Advisory: GHSA-jmh9-6rjq-gjh9
Package: pimcore/pimcore
Verified: 10.6.9
Summary: The image editor bundle carries jQuery 3.4.1 as a private webpack module (no window.$). The module wrapper now sets jQuery.htmlPrefilter to an identity function after the factory returns, so HTML is no longer rewritten before parsing (CVE-2020-11022). The option-in-select wrapping behind CVE-2020-11023 is not changed; it does not reproduce in current browsers. Run bin/console assets:install afterwards; bundle.js.map is not regenerated.
